  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG COVID-19 Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment consolidated several activities focused on supporting the COVID-19 pandemic response in PNG.  It included support to (1) NGO&#x2019;s to rapidly scale up existing programming to reduce the risk of COVID-19 community transmission and assist in the rollout of vaccines (Australian Humanitarian Partnership); (2) Laboratory Strengthening and procurement and distribution of GeneXpert and rapid antigen testing; (3) AUSMAT Team deployments to PNG to support its response to COVID-19 Delta Variant Surge Outbreak; (4) Provision of medical supplies, transport/storage, supply and provision of PPE, and additional AUSMAT-specific supplies; logistics support for Critical Response Teams, AUSMAT and NZMAT team members (5) PNG COVID-19 vaccines roll out through ISOS; (6) Deployment of Australian clinicians into the PNG hospital system; and (7) COVID-19 communications research.</narrative>
  </description>
